### Uploader des images sur un produit
@productId =6a0b880158f695dc3484c1b9
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/products/{{productId}}/images
Authorization: Basic {{adminCredentials}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="collier.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ../docs/collier5.jpg
--boundary--

### Lister les IDs de produits (page HTML)
GET http://localhost:8080/products
Accept: text/html

### Charger la card d'un produit (fragment HTMX)
GET http://localhost:8080/products/{{productId}}/card
Accept: text/html

### Télécharger une image
@imageId = variable value
GET http://localhost:8080/images/{{imageId}}